  training with just the staff the  students were not there one of the  things that these teachers are told that  they have to do is when the shooter in  the enters the school they barricade  themselves in the classroom with their  students students have to protect  themselves you put desks up basically  you try to create body armor out of  whatever sitting around the room there  and here's the sickest part if the  teacher after locking and barricading  the door hears or sees a student in the  hallway outside their door screaming  crying being shot begging to get into  their classroom to get safe they are  forbidden from opening the door to let  that student in they sit there and they  watch that person died my wife mentioned  that upon hearing that and being taught  that everything in that room changed  every single teacher sat there in horror  as they were being told that hey when  you hear that person screaming you just  gotta let it happen because you can't  risk the lives of everybody else that is  again unique to this 18 to 29 year old  generation that is getting more  politically active and they need to be  they deserve to be think of how screwed  up everything is in this country right  now and I am NOT just talking about what  Trump has done things were bad before  him I think these kids deserve it these  young Americans these adults these  Patriots whatever you want to call them  it's their turn we have screwed things  up so badly as a country and not just on  the issue of school shootings the issue  climate  is hugely important for this age group  that's something they have lived with  their entire lives meanwhile most of us  in this country climate change wasn't  something we dealt with in childhood  summers were so mild even where I live  in the state of Florida summers were  still so mild she could go outside and  not die of heatstroke but we're seeing  an increase in the amount of heat stroke  deaths all across this country it  occasionally would snow where I'm at in  Florida in the winter those days are  gone because of the rising temperatures  the rising sea levels that are taking  away our coastlines the beach here that  is 20 minutes from where I'm sitting  right now is lost about half of its  landmass just during my lifetime and  that's going to continue 20-30 years it  won't exist anymore but here's the thing  these kids understand it and I hate to  call them kids I do not mean that in a  derogatory way this group these citizens  these Patriots understand it they see  these things they want to fix these  things whether they're left or right or  libertarian or Green Party it doesn't  matter as much to them they see the  problems they've lived with the problems  they live with them every day and  they're sick and tired of these  politicians in DC that aren't doing  anything about it
 

